function onCreated()
{
  showcharacter();
  this.nick="Pvt. Teller Lochdonan, Constable of the (Road Wardens)";
  this.head="val-garsidehead.gif";
  this.body="val_roadwarden-body100.gif";
  this.shield="no-shield.gif";
  setcharani("idle","idle");
  this.dir=3;
}
function onPlayertouchsme()
{
Sign.Display(this.nick,
"::Sternly watches you.:: \"Hey you! Halt!
Please...
You have no idea how stressful this is.
If it isnt Gaffer always yelling, at the rare times he is home,
It's his wife yelling at him to boot! Guess it's for not being home on time.
And then it's the kids. One has me regulating bug fights.
I didnt even know bugs grow that big. And I don't like bugs.
Bugs give me the heebie-jeebies. ::Shudders::
But hey, the pay at this post is better than most, and it's not like I
have to do much other than shoo away unwanted guests...Uh...
Shades! But don't tell Gaffer I complained. In Setengar's name.
I don't think my ears could take it. I may go deaf!\"
");
}
